# The I2C buses of display adapters (PCI class 0x03), for the user of the
# active session: vela-brightness speaks DDC/CI on them without root
# (docs/brightness.md §6, §13). The same rule as ddcutil's, harmless if both
# are installed. Before 73-seat-late.rules, which applies uaccess.
SUBSYSTEM=="i2c-dev", KERNEL=="i2c-[0-9]*", ATTRS{class}=="0x03*", TAG+="uaccess"
